      "writtenOn": "2025-05-12T03:39:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Tim,\nThis change is not from any commit , if i do git blame , it shows merge commit only . you can refer https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blame/6f0f335b73a9264050e031879ad04c551c05959c/drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_dp_mst.c\n\nplease search \"ret \u003d drm_connector_dynamic_init(display-\u003edrm, connector, \u0026mst_connecto\"  , you can see specific line is changed by merge commit . These kind of unclean merge sometimes happen . If you have a better way of taking this change , please let me know so that i can abandon this patch and follow your way",
      "parentUuid": "cbf3539b_51a0f86f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 52
